document('/architecture.html','Architecture and <em>UML workflow.</em>','Every workflow step includes its corresponding coloured code excerpt.','<p class="note">This UML diagram groups configuration, runtime discovery and post-result measurement. SDK servers run in the host process; model inference is remote.</p><a class="button" href="/architecture.svg" download>Download UML SVG</a><div class="diagram"><img src="/architecture.svg" alt="Thirteen tool-search workflow steps"></div>'+walk)

reference=[('Classroom scope', 'All 90 tools are real local read-only handlers. No Slack, Jira, GitHub or production database integration is implied. Search, model calls and context measurements use the actual Agent SDK.'), ('Measure honestly', 'getContextUsage detail full counts context categories. Compare categories by kind and id, not English names alone. Deferred schemas are out of window. JSON catalog bytes are not tokens. Post-result totals include different generated messages and discovery calls.'), ('Auto thresholds', 'The requested value auto:5 does not guarantee a search call. Below its context-percentage threshold, upfront loading is expected. Counts, schemas, model context, deployment support and organizational settings affect behavior.'), ('Discovery experiment', 'Only the course-notes tool name, description and searchHint improve. The returned record remains the same. One successful query is illustrative; it cannot establish a statistically significant accuracy gain.'), ('Version-aware support', 'The supplied slides describe older gateway defaults and 4.5-generation support. Current official docs say gateways default on with newer Claude Code versions and document a broader supported-model set. Installed package behavior and actual events take precedence. Microsoft Foundry deployments and policy restrictions may still force fallback.'), ('Documented limits', 'Official docs describe up to 10,000 tools and up to five matches per search by default. This application registers 90 tools and records returned references; it does not benchmark the limit or claim every search returns exactly five.'), ('Always-loaded critical tool', 'Only catalog_status is marked alwaysLoad true. It stays eligible for immediate use. Other tools remain deferred when search is active; authorization still applies.'), ('Cost and privacy', 'Live model queries and full context counts may incur API usage. Each experiment has an SDK budget threshold of $0.65, which is not a prepaid cap. Only the configured model credential is needed; secrets and all teaching media remain excluded from Git.')]
document('/walkthrough.html','How the app <em>was built.</em>','Every architecture step has source-linked coloured code.',cards(reference)+walk)
readme='# Claude Agent SDK · Lesson 26 · Tool search at scale\n\nFive linked student pages, large text, actual SDK experiments and coloured code in all thirteen UML steps.\n\n## What you will learn\n\n'+''.join(f'- {a}: {b}\n' for a,b in learn)
readme+='\n## Configure and run\n\n```powershell\ngit clone https://github.com/luiscoco/Udemy-Claude-Agent-SDK-lesson26-app.git\ncd .\\Udemy-Claude-Agent-SDK-lesson26-app\nnpm ci\nif (!(Test-Path .env)) { Copy-Item .env.example .env }\nnotepad .env\nnpm start\n```\n\nFrom presentations use `cd .\\agent-sdk\\lesson26-tool-search`. Open http://127.0.0.1:3126 and keep the terminal running. Node.js 24+, API credit and model access are required. Windows may require Git Bash.\n\n## Create your .env file\n\nPreserve an existing file. Enter your own model key, then restart. Existing shell values take precedence.\n\n```dotenv\n'+env+'\n```\n\nNo GitHub token or Managed Agents IDs are required. Secrets, dependencies and teaching media stay outside Git.\n\n## Run the experiments\n\n'
for title,explanation,code in runsteps[3:]:readme+=f'### {title}\n\n{explanation}\n\n```powershell\n{code}\n```\n\n'
readme+='## How the app was built\n\n'
for step in steps:readme+=f'### {step["number"]}. {step["title"]}\n\n{step["explanation"]}\n\nSource: `{step["source"]}`, selected lines {step["firstLine"]}–{step["lastLine"]}. Surrounding code omitted.\n\n```typescript\n{step["code"]}\n```\n\n'
readme+='## Reference topics and limits\n\n'+''.join(f'- {a}: {b}\n' for a,b in reference)+'\n## References\n\n- [Official SDK tool-search documentation](https://code.claude.com/docs/en/agent-sdk/tool-search)\n- [TypeScript SDK reference](https://code.claude.com/docs/en/agent-sdk/typescript)\n\nRegenerate student pages with `python scripts/build-pages.py`. Run `npm test` for offline configuration and startup checks.\n'
(APP/'README.md').write_text(readme,encoding='utf-8')
print('Built five Lesson 26 pages and thirteen source-linked UML steps.')
